<%# sandbox="allow-scripts" — JS runs inside the iframe so demos work,
    but the absence of allow-same-origin keeps the document in a unique
    opaque origin: no access to our cookies, storage, DOM, or session.
    Forms, top-nav, popups, and downloads stay blocked. Never add
    allow-same-origin alongside allow-scripts — that combination is
    equivalent to no sandbox at all. %>
<iframe class="preview-html" sandbox="allow-scripts" allow="fullscreen"
        data-fullscreen-target="frame"
        srcdoc="<%= previewer.full_content %>"></iframe>
